// The people of Hollowbrook. Talking to someone starts the node their entry in world.yaml names.
//
// The game sets these variables before each conversation: $coins and $potions (how many the bag holds), $quest (the state of the glowcaps quest: inactive, active or completed), $ready (the glowcaps are gathered and Thornhide is beaten), $hasSword (the iron sword is in the bag or equipped) and $hurt (HP is below its maximum).
//
// Commands change the game: <<give item count>> and <<take item count>> add and remove items, <<start quest>> starts a quest, <<talked person>> counts toward a quest's talk objective, and <<heal>> restores every HP.

title: Mira
---
<<if $quest == "completed">>
    Mira: The shrine hasn't burned this bright in years. Hollowbrook owes you. #expr:smile
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if $quest == "active" and $ready>>
    Mira: Three glowcaps, and Thornhide gone from the meadow! Let me light the lamp. #expr:smile
    <<take glowcap 3>>
    <<talked mira>>
    Mira: Take this charm. It keeps a little of the flame.
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if $quest == "active">>
    Mira: Three glowcaps from Whisper Meadow, east through the gate. Mind Thornhide.
<<else>>
    Mira: The shrine lamp went out last night. Only glowcaps from the meadow will light it again.
    Mira: But Thornhide, the old bramble boar, has the gatherers too scared to go. Will you fetch three?
    -> I'll bring them.
        <<start glowcaps>>
        Mira: Thank you! Bram sells better steel than that stick, if you can pay for it. #expr:smile
    -> Not yet.
        Mira: The lamp can wait a little longer. Come back when you're ready.
<<endif>>
-> Could you tend my wounds? <<if $hurt>>
    <<heal>>
    Mira: There. Rest is half of courage. #expr:smile
-> Goodbye.
===

title: Bram
---
<<if $hasSword>>
    Bram: That blade will hold its edge. Open your pack to wear it. #expr:smile
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Bram: An iron sword, fresh from the anvil. Twenty coins.
-> Buy it for 20 coins. <<if $coins >= 20>>
    <<take coin 20>>
    <<give iron-sword 1>>
    Bram: A fair trade. Equip it from your pack before you go hunting. #expr:smile
-> I can't afford it. <<if $coins < 20>>
    Bram: The moss slimes in the meadow carry coins, if you're quick with that stick.
-> Just looking.
    Bram: Looking is free.
===

title: Pell
---
<<if not visited("PellGift")>>
    <<jump PellGift>>
<<endif>>
Pell: Walk into a foe to fight it. You can flee from a slime, but Thornhide won't let you go.
===

title: PellGift
---
Pell: Heading into the meadow? Take this. Nobody needs a potion standing at a gate. #expr:smile
<<give potion 1>>
Pell: Walk into a foe to fight it. You can flee from a slime, but Thornhide won't let you go.
===
